<p>jab sadr-e- zee'n se gir pade abbas-e- baawafaa<br />
jangal se aayi girya-e- zehra ki bhi sadaa<br />
akbar ne doudh kar shah-e- waala se ye kahaa<br />
chaliye huzoor neher pa maare gaye chacha</p>

<p>be dast dushmanou'n ne kiya is diler ko<br />
ro aaiye taraayi me hyder ke sher ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sun ke peet'te huwe utthe zamee'n se shaah<br />
farmaaya hai ghazab mere bacche huwe tabaah<br />
ye kya kaha ke aankhou'n me din hogaya siyaah<br />
mazloom se bichad gaye abbas aah aah</p>

<p>muddat huwi tamaam sakina ke chain ki<br />
toda falak ne aaj kamar ko hussain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke soo-e- naher chale shaah-e- karbala<br />
maanind-e- baid kaanpte the sheh ke dast-o- paa<br />
ammama tha na farq pa ne dosh par ridaa<br />
tasveer waar the hamathan sibte mustafa</p>

<p>maqtal ki qaak se tan-e- anwar ata huwaa<br />
seena khula huwa tha garebaa'n phata huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pahonche ju hi taraai me baadeeda-e- pur aab<br />
dekha tapaa'n hai qaak pa farzand-e- buturaab<br />
shaanou'n pa ki nazar to jigar me rahi na taab<br />
bas haaye bhaai kehke giraa wo falak janaab</p>

<p>bekaar dast-o-paa the shah-e qushqisaal ke<br />
le aaye laash tak ali akbar sambhaal ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mu rakh ke qoo'n bhare huwe chehre pa di sadaa<br />
bhaiyya hussain aaya hai aawaaz do zaraa<br />
haye haath dono haath badan se huwe judaa<br />
baazu ke sadqe un tere shaanou'n ke mai fidaa</p>

<p>bhaiyya hamaare haath to bekaar hogaye<br />
tum haath khoke jaafar-e- tayyar hogaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunkar sadaa-e- hazrate shabbir-e- naamdaar<br />
khola lahu bhari huwi aankhou'n ko ek baar<br />
sar rakh ke paa-e- shah pa ye bola wo zee wiqaar<br />
tashreef aap laaye zah-e- izz-o- ifteqaar</p>

<p>jee chaahta hai ye ke nisaar-e- huzoor hoo'n<br />
kis tarha uth ke gird phiroo'n choor choor hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baithe hai aap aur mai letaa hu aah aah<br />
kya dour hai huzoor agar baqsh de'n gunaah<br />
sar shaq hai zarb-e-gurz se ya shaah-e-dee'n panaah<br />
karwat bhi ab to le nahi sakta hai qair qwaah</p>

<p>dukhte hai bolne me jarahath phate huwe<br />
dekhe'n huzoor mere hai baazu kate huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mu rakh ke mu pa kahne lage shaah-e- qushqisaal<br />
abbas mai kin aankhou'n se dekhu tera ye haal<br />
is dam bhi hai tumhe mere aadaab ka qayaal<br />
jab zib'ha honge hum to kise hoyega malaal</p>

<p>sadqe hussain tere tan-e- paash paash ke<br />
ek baar hamko gird to phirne do laash ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sun ke us diler ne ek sard aah ki<br />
mashkize pe tadap ke ba hasrath nigaah ki<br />
mu sharm se chupaa liya godi me shaah ki<br />
haalat tabaah ho gayi hyder ke maah ki</p>

<p>jab dil ko bekali ho to kis tarha kal pade<br />
zaanu pa sheh ke aankhou'n se aansu nikal pade<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaya sheh ne kis liye rote ho zaar zaar<br />
lo ab kuch apna haal kaho tum pa mai nisaar<br />
kya ji pa hai bani jo tadapte ho baar baar<br />
ki arz is jari ne ke hai waqt-e- iqtezaar</p>

<p>aaqa se chootne ka qalaq hai ghulaam ko<br />
paaunga ab kahaa'n shah-e- gardou'n maqaam ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte the ke phirgayi aankhou'n ki putliyaa'n<br />
hichki ke saath aagayi sookhe labou'n pa jaa'n<br />
hasrat se dekhkar taraf-e- shaah-e- inso-o- jaa'n<br />
dunya se kooch kargaye abbas-e- noujawaa'n</p>

<p>chodha jari ne saath shah-e- mashraqain ka<br />
ek ghul uthaa ke margaya aashiq hussain ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillati hai ye zouja-e- abbas-e- naamwar<br />
chodo mujhe qudaa ke liye peetne do sar<br />
waaris mera guzar gaya loota ajal ne ghar<br />
hae hae yateem hogaye dono mere pisar</p>

<p>pardes me ali ke pisar se bichad gayi<br />
ab khaak udaane do ke meri maang ujad gayi<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>